        "uuid": "cab95f7c_d2b4a6e1",
        "filename": "drivers/iommu/intel/pkvm/iommu_hc.c",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 518,
      "author": {
        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-22T16:10:03Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "In fact, looks like this patch doesn\u0027t change anything at all (modulo possible bugs it may be introducing :)). It basically just recalculates here at runtime what we already calculated when setting `iommu-\u003eagaw` before deprivileging? IOW, it uses `cap_sagaw(iommu-\u003ecap)` instead of `iommu-\u003eagaw`, but using exactly the same `iommu` pointer as before this patch; so it doesn\u0027t address the actual problem: the host may pass different `iommu` values (i.e. different `data-\u003ephys` values, corresponding to different IOMMUs) in different hypercalls using the _same_ domain?",
      "parentUuid": "524d2a3c_e3a5a248",
      "revId": "e9b7ac9f27e73f9da0f1e544eed112afed3647d6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
